format: loopthing/package-v0.2
title: The Missing Artifact
kind: sanitized-session-package
created: 2026-04-29T07:18:00Z
start: START.md
origin: OpenAI Codex hackathon demo

summary:
  A .loopthing is a package for AI work: a forkable, auditable collection
  of sanitized prompts, user-input track changes, killed ideas, reasons,
  and produced artifacts that shows how an idea arrived.

lineage:
  - Began as a static OpenAI Codex hackathon viewer.
  - Used OpenClaw as the first source artifact.
  - Tried a GitHub repo input direction.
  - Killed "LoopThing a repo" because the repo is not the thinking process.
  - Landed on a package whose spine is sanitized user input plus artifacts.

principles:
  - Not a JSON file
  - Not a raw chat dump
  - Not a repo diff
  - Sanitized user inputs are the spine
  - Produced artifacts travel with the thinking loop

